<div class="lp" data-locale="en"><div class="lp-shell"><header class="lp-nav"><a class="lp-wordmark" href="/" data-discover="true"><span class="lp-wordmark-name">NEXTBODY</span><span class="lp-pip" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><nav class="lp-nav-mid" aria-label="Primary"><a class="lp-nav-link" href="#band">THE BAND</a><a class="lp-nav-link" href="#app">THE APP</a><a class="lp-nav-link" href="#science">SCIENCE</a></nav><div class="lp-nav-end"><div class="lp-langs"><span class="lp-lang is-on">EN</span><span class="lp-lang-rule"></span><a class="lp-lang" href="/pages/zh" data-discover="true">中文</a></div><a class="lp-sign" href="/account/login" data-discover="true">SIGN IN</a><a class="lp-pill" href="/collections/all" data-discover="true">GET HOOP</a></div></header><section class="lp-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="lp-hero-bg"></div><div class="lp-hero-scrim"></div><div class="lp-hero-inner"><div class="lp-hero-lock"><div><div class="lp-hero-kicker"><span class="lp-pip"></span><p>NEXTBODY · HOOP · THE SCREENLESS BAND</p></div><h1 id="hero-title">BUILD YOUR<br/>NEXT BODY.</h1></div><div class="lp-hero-bottom"><p class="lp-hero-lede">A band with no screen. It reads your heart, sleep, and training all day, and says it plainly in the app.</p><div class="lp-hero-cta"><a class="lp-pill lp-pill-hero" href="/collections/all" data-discover="true">Get HOOP — $99<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 8h10M8.5 3.5 13 8l-4.5 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><div class="lp-hero-nosub"><i></i><span>No subscription. Ever.</span></div></div></div></div><div class="lp-hero-floor"><span>NO SCREEN</span><span>5 DAYS PER CHARGE</span><span>$99 · NO SUBSCRIPTION</span><span>READ IN THE APP</span></div></div></section><section class="lp-gallery" id="band"><div class="lp-gallery-head"><div class="lp-gallery-copy"><p class="lp-kicker-lime">THE OBJECT</p><h2 class="lp-display-title">Nothing to look at.<br/>Everything to feel.</h2></div><div class="lp-gallery-aside"><p>A brushed steel frame around a woven loop. No glass, no glow. The band is the whole design.</p><span>Six shots · drop renders in</span></div></div><div class="lp-gallery-row"><div class="lp-shot" style="background-image:url({{ 'buckle.png' | asset_url }})"></div><div class="lp-shot" style="background-image:url({{ 'weave.png' | asset_url }})"></div><div class="lp-shot lp-shot-sensor" style="background-image:url({{ 'sensor.png' | asset_url }})"><b>04 · MACRO</b><span>4:5</span></div></div></section><section class="lp-hl" id="app"><div class="lp-hl-head"><div><p class="lp-hl-kicker">HOOP</p><h2 class="lp-hl-title">Get the highlights.</h2></div></div><div class="lp-hl-grid"><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-hl-media" style="background-image:url({{ 'light.png' | asset_url }})"></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>AIR</b><p>So light you forget it is there.</p></div></article><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-hl-media" style="background-image:url({{ 'water.png' | asset_url }})"></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>WATER</b><p>Swim in it. Shower in it. Keep it on.</p></div></article><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-triad"><div><div class="lp-triad-row"><strong>72%</strong><span>BODY BATTERY</span></div></div><div><hr/><div class="lp-triad-row"><strong>14.9</strong><span>TRAINING</span></div></div><div><hr/><div class="lp-triad-row"><strong>-728</strong><span>CALORIES</span></div></div></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>THREE NUMBERS</b><p>When to train. How much to eat.</p></div></article><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-scan"><div class="lp-scan-bg"></div><div class="lp-scan-plate"><div class="lp-scan-col"><strong>21.4<em> <!-- -->%</em></strong><span>BODY FAT</span></div><i class="lp-scan-rule"></i><div class="lp-scan-col"><strong>21.3</strong><span>BMI</span></div></div></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>BODY SCAN</b><p>Body fat from the wrist. No scale.</p></div></article><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-mini-coach"><div class="lp-mini-q"><span>Why am I so tired today?</span></div><div class="lp-mini-a"><div class="lp-mini-a-k"><i></i><span>AI COACH</span></div><p>Short night. Take today light.</p><span class="lp-mini-act">Adjust today’s plan</span></div></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>AI COACH</b><p>Reads your night. Plans your day.</p></div></article><article class="lp-hl-card"><div class="lp-lock"><div class="lp-island"><div class="lp-island-l"><i></i><span>RUN 24:13</span></div><div class="lp-island-r"><strong>142</strong><span>BPM</span></div></div><div class="lp-today"><div class="lp-today-k">TODAY</div><div class="lp-today-row"><div class="lp-today-col"><strong>72</strong><span>BATTERY</span></div><div class="lp-today-col"><strong>14.9</strong><span>LOAD</span></div><div class="lp-today-col"><strong>1,240</strong><span>EATEN</span></div></div></div></div><div class="lp-hl-copy"><b>HOME SCREEN</b><p>Your day, without opening the app.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="lp-app"><div class="lp-app-copy"><h2>See your state at a glance.</h2><p>Body Battery, last night&#x27;s sleep, heart rate, and stress — all in the real NextBody.</p><span>For iPhone.</span><a class="lp-app-cta" href="#science">See the App</a></div><div class="lp-phones"><div class="lp-phone lp-phone-s lp-phone-sleep"><div class="lp-phone-screen"><img alt="" src="{{ 'phone-sleep.png' | asset_url }}"/></div><div class="lp-phone-notch"></div></div><div class="lp-phone lp-phone-m lp-phone-vitals"><div class="lp-phone-screen"><img alt="" src="{{ 'phone-vitals.png' | asset_url }}"/></div><div class="lp-phone-notch"></div></div><div class="lp-phone lp-phone-l"><div class="lp-phone-screen"><img alt="" src="{{ 'phone-home.png' | asset_url }}"/></div><div class="lp-phone-notch"></div></div><div class="lp-phone lp-phone-m lp-phone-battery"><div class="lp-phone-screen"><img alt="" src="{{ 'phone-battery.png' | asset_url }}"/></div><div class="lp-phone-notch"></div></div><div class="lp-phone lp-phone-s lp-phone-heart"><div class="lp-phone-screen"><img alt="" src="{{ 'phone-heart.png' | asset_url }}"/></div><div class="lp-phone-notch"></div></div></div></section><section class="lp-radar"><div class="lp-radar-copy"><b>THREE CORE NUMBERS</b><h2>Three numbers<br/>run the cut.</h2><p>Body Battery tells you how much you have left to spend today. Training tells you how hard to go. Calories tells you how much to eat.</p></div><img alt="" src="{{ 'radar.png' | asset_url }}"/></section><section class="lp-comp"><div class="lp-comp-head"><b>Composition</b><h2>Read your body live.</h2><p>Fat, muscle, water, and bone — scanned from the wrist. The first scan is day zero. Scan again anytime.</p></div><div class="lp-comp-hero"><div class="lp-comp-phone"><div class="lp-comp-status"><span>9:41</span><svg width="82" height="22" viewBox="0 0 82 22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.7 13H2.5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1.2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V14a1 1 0 0 0-1-1m5.2-2.5H7.7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1.2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1M14.1 8h-1.2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1.2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9a1 1 0 0 0-1-1m5.2-2.5h-1.2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h1.2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-10a1 1 0 0 0-1-1" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M36.57 7.8c2.49 0 4.88.92 6.68 2.58.14.13.36.12.49 0l1.3-1.27a.34.34 0 0 0 0-.5 12.55 12.55 0 0 0-16.93 0 .34.34 0 0 0 0 .5l1.3 1.26c.13.13.34.14.48 0a10 10 0 0 1 6.68-2.57m0 4.22a5.4 5.4 0 0 1 3.67 1.44c.14.13.35.13.48 0l1.3-1.33a.37.37 0 0 0-.01-.52 7.9 7.9 0 0 0-10.88 0 .37.37 0 0 0 0 .52l1.29 1.32c.13.14.34.14.48 0 1-.92 2.31-1.43 3.67-1.43m2.52 2.8q0 .15-.1.28l-2.18 2.45a.3.3 0 0 1-.24.11.3.3 0 0 1-.24-.1l-2.18-2.46a.43.43 0 0 1 .01-.56 3.44 3.44 0 0 1 4.82 0 .4.4 0 0 1 .11.28" clip-rule="evenodd" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M70.5 5c2.05 0 3.08 0 3.88.34a4.3 4.3 0 0 1 2.28 2.28c.34.8.34 1.83.34 3.88s0 3.08-.34 3.88a4.3 4.3 0 0 